{"thread":{"threadID":4972,"boardID":228,"topic":"controler","time":1511981745,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","lastPostTime":1511984973,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":11,"views":192,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":74116,"threadID":4972,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"controler","time":1511981745,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1511982293,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1511984756,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1511985022,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1511995085,"value":1},{"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","time":1511982134,"value":-1},{"userID":2576,"username":"TimeShot","time":1511983058,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey guys, so I have some spare money right now and I wanted to buy a controler to play rocket league and some other games which are better with it. But I have no experience with it so I ask you if you could tell me about controllers that you have or some good that you know about. It would be nice if it was around and under 40 euros. Thanks people  <span class=\"missing-media\">[8)]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74117,"threadID":4972,"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","subject":"","time":1511982333,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Do you like the xbox controller or the playstation one ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74118,"threadID":4972,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1511982485,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>I have never used xbox and PS seems good to me so far so I would say PS</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74128,"threadID":4972,"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","subject":"","time":1511983042,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Because the only difference between those two controllers are the joystick position so you would prefer the ps one ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74130,"threadID":4972,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1511983400,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985109,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Thorin Pikachu</strong></cite><p>I have never used xbox and PS seems good to me so far so I would say PS<br></p></blockquote><p>Cool, take the xbox one controller</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74131,"threadID":4972,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1511983830,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1511984155,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985103,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/Xbox-One-Elite-Wireless-Controller/dp/B00ZV0NH40/ref=sr_1_1?s=videogames&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1511983765&amp;amp;sr=1-1&amp;amp;keywords=Xbox+one+elite+controller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>That would be the Master Race</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>and here is one you could afford</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/Official-Xbox-Wireless-Controller-White/dp/B01GVN10VM/ref=sr_1_2?s=videogames&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1511983795&amp;amp;sr=1-2&amp;amp;keywords=Xbox%2Bone%2Bcontroller&amp;amp;th=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74132,"threadID":4972,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1511983939,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Thank you <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1173-nightlight/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nightlight</a> for your time, I will take a look.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74133,"threadID":4972,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1511984630,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985096,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>As far as i know ps3 controller works with mist games with the xbox driver. Never had problems with it</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74134,"threadID":4972,"userID":2547,"username":"Perks","subject":"","time":1511984678,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511984994,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I would suggest you the Xbox-Controller. I bought it 3 Years ago and it still is working. Ive got this <a href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/Controller-Shoulders-Improved-Ergonomic-Microsoft/dp/B0721JKNV7/ref=sr_1_9?s=videogames&amp;amp;ie=UTF8&amp;amp;qid=1511984567&amp;amp;sr=1-9&amp;amp;keywords=xbox+controller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a>.<br>If you want more quality i would suggest the controller from nightlight.<br>Btw <span class=\"missing-media\">[sry]</span> for my bad english. I hope you could understand it.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74135,"threadID":4972,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"","time":1511984740,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985092,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I would recommend a xbox 360 controller with usb cable cause then you don&#x27;t need the battery charge all the time and it&#x27;s faster, and cheaper!!!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Wired-USB-Controller-Xbox-Black/dp/B01EVFGK4O\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Microsoft-Xbox-360-Wired-Controller/dp/B003ZSN600\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74136,"threadID":4972,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1511984796,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985089,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I prefer a xbox controller (all games shows the xbox buttons instead of the psX buttons (assassins creed origns for example) - it&#x27;s a bit confusing with a psX controller)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74138,"threadID":4972,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1511984973,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1511985153,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>True story bara, but also you dont have the barery provlems with usb cable...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mist cheap controllers are exactly that... cheap... would reconmend buying ps or xbox controller.</p>","polls":[]}]}